{% comment %}
  Calder Wheels — Fitment Data Provider
  Provides vehicle fitment data to the storefront.

  Two data modes:
    1. LIVE API (primary): The middleware Fitment API server auto-syncs with
       NHTSA and serves live data. Set CALDER_FITMENT_API_URL in theme settings
       or set window.CALDER_FITMENT_API before this renders.
    2. EMBEDDED (fallback): Static JSON generated from the NHTSA seeder.
       Regenerate by running:
         cd fitment && python nhtsa_seeder.py --db fitment.db --years 2010-2026
         python export_fitment_data.py --db fitment.db --liquid ../shopify/snippets/fitment-data.liquid

  The fitment-finder.js tries the API first, then falls back to embedded data.
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign fitment_api_url = settings.fitment_api_url | default: 'https://calder-dev.covedigitalworks.com'
  assign configurator_api_url = settings.configurator_api_url | default: 'https://calder-dev.covedigitalworks.com'
-%}

<script>
  window.CALDER_FITMENT_API = '{{ fitment_api_url }}';
  window.CALDER_API_BASE = '{{ configurator_api_url }}';
</script>

<script id="fitment-data-json" type="application/json">
{"vehicles": []}
</script>

<script>
  window.__fitmentData = {"vehicles": []};
</script>